  "steps": [
    "Slice beef into thin strips. Season with garlic powder, smoked paprika, salt and pepper.",
    "Cut watermelon and cucumber into cubes. Tear lettuce.",
    "Fry beef in oil on medium-high 1 minute per side. Rest 2 minutes; slice.",
    "Toss salad with lime juice and mint. Top with beef and crumbled feta."
